      "sampleA1": "<p>No, I don't notice. I see big things. Not small things.</p>",
      "sampleA2": "<p>I don't see small details. But I see big things. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">And</span> I like places.</p>",
      "sampleB1": "<p>I don't usually notice small details. I <span class=\"ml-token colloc\">look at</span> the big things. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, if something is very strange, I see it. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">For example</span>, if a wall is a strange color. I prefer to see the whole place.</p>",
      "sampleB2": "<p>I don't usually pay attention to small details when I visit a place. I'm more focused on the overall impression. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, if something is really unusual or striking, it will catch my eye. <span class=\"ml-token colloc\">For instance</span>, a strange piece of art or an interesting architectural detail.</p>",
      "uzSampleAnswer": "<p>Rostini aytsam, men yangi joylardagi mayda detallarga ayniqsa e'tibor beraman deb ayta olmayman. Men ko'proq katta manzara, joyning umumiy muhiti va taassurotiga e'tibor qarataman. Shunga qaramay, agar biror narsa ayniqsa hayratlanarli yoki o'z o'rnida bo'lmasa, u albatta ko'zimga tashlanadi. Misol uchun, g'ayrioddiy arxitektura elementi yoki ko'cha san'atining ayniqsa yorqin namunasi.</p> <p>Umuman olganda, menimcha, men joyning aniq jismoniy elementlaridan ko'ra ko'proq hissiy kayfiyatiga moslashganman. Men devorlarning aniq rangini eslay olmasligim mumkin, lekin bu joy menga qanday ta'sir qilganini eslayman. Bu ko'proq butun tajriba haqida, uning qismlari yig'indisidan ko'ra. Bu, menimcha, daraxtlar orasida o'rmonni ko'rishga o'xshaydi.</p>",
