      "sampleB1": "<p>I like museums. I can see old things. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">For example</span>, old cars or old clothes. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, sometimes they are boring. There are too many people.</p>",
      "sampleB2": "<p>I do like visiting museums, but it depends on the type of museum. I enjoy art museums and history museums the most. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, science museums are not really my thing. I find them a bit boring. I think it's important to <span class=\"ml-token phrasal\">immerse yourself in</span> culture, and museums are a great way to do that.</p>",
      "uzSampleAnswer": "<p>Mening muzeylar bilan munosabatim biroz murakkab. Bir tomondan, men san'at, tarix va madaniyat bilan aniq tarzda tanishish imkoniyatini qadrlayman. Tarixiy artefaktni yoki mashhur rasmni kitobda yoki onlaynda emas, balki shaxsan ko'rishda o'zgacha bir narsa bor. Qolaversa, muzeylar bilim olish va uni kengaytirish uchun ajoyib joy bo'lishi mumkin.</p> <p>Biroq, men shuni ham bilamanki, muzeylar ba'zan haddan tashqari bosim o'tkazishi mumkin. Olomon, shovqin va ma'lumotlarning haddan tashqari ko'pligi charchatadi. Ko'pincha bir necha soatdan keyin diqqatimni yo'qotaman. Aslida, bu aralash tuyg'ular. Menimcha, bu aniq muzeyga va o'sha kundagi kayfiyatimga bog'liq. Asosan, men uni qabul ham qila olaman, rad ham eta olaman.</p>",
      "uzSampleA1": "<p>Ha, menga muzeylar yoqadi. Men eski narsalarni ko'raman. Ular yaxshi.</p>",
      "uzSampleA2": "<p>Men muzeylarni yaxshi ko'raman. <br> Va men eski narsalarni ko'raman. <br> Lekin ba'zida ular zerikarli bo'ladi.</p>",
      "uzSampleB1": "<p>Menga muzeylar yoqadi. Men eski narsalarni ko'rishim mumkin. <br>Masalan, eski mashinalar yoki eski kiyimlar. <br>Biroq, ba'zida ular zerikarli bo'ladi. Juda ko'p odam bor.</p>",
      "uzSampleB2": "<p>Men muzeylarga borishni yoqtiraman, lekin bu muzeyning turiga bog'liq. Men ko'proq san'at muzeylari va tarix muzeylaridan zavqlanaman. <br>Biroq, fan muzeylari menga unchalik yoqmaydi. Men ularni biroz zerikarli deb bilaman. Menimcha, madaniyatga sho'ng'ish muhim va muzeylar buning uchun ajoyib usuldir.</p>"
