      "sampleA1": "<p>I like videos. Videos are good. Books are boring.</p>",
      "sampleA2": "<p>I like videos. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">And</span> they are fun. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">But</span> books are boring.</p>",
      "sampleB1": "<p>I prefer videos. Videos are more interesting than books. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">For example</span>, I can see things. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, books have more information. It depends on what I want to learn.</p>",
      "sampleB2": "<p>I generally prefer reading books to learn something. I find that I can concentrate better when I'm reading. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">Also</span>, I can <span class=\"ml-token phrasal\">go back over</span> sections that I didn't understand. <span class=\"ml-token adv\">However</span>, I understand that some people prefer videos. It really depends on your learning style.</p>",
      "uzSampleAnswer": "<p>Shaxsan men uchun o'qish orqali yaxshiroq o'rganaman. Videolar qiziqarli va vizual jihatdan rag'batlantiruvchi bo'lishi mumkin bo'lsa-da, menimcha, ma'lumotlar nimadir o'qiganimdagidek chuqur singib ketmaydi. O'qiganimda, men tempni nazorat qila olaman, tushunmagan qismlarimni qayta ko'rib chiqaman va eslatmalar yozib olaman. Bu men uchun yanada faol va chuqur o'rganish tajribasi.</p> <p>Shuni aytishim kerakki, videolarning ham o'z afzalliklari borligini tan olaman. Ular, ayniqsa, vizual o'rganuvchilar uchun foydali bo'lishi mumkin va ular ko'pincha murakkab tushunchalarni yanada tushunarli tarzda tushuntirib berishlari mumkin. Oxir oqibat, menimcha, bu individual o'rganish uslublariga va qo'l ostidagi mavzuga bog'liq. Har kimning o'z didi bor, deyishadi. Ammo agar men birini tanlashim kerak bo'lsa, men o'qishga moyil bo'lardim. Bilim - kuch, va o'qish men uchun uni ochadi.</p>",
      "uzSampleA1": "<p>Menga videolar yoqadi. Videolar yaxshi. Kitoblar zerikarli.</p>",
      "uzSampleA2": "<p>Menga videolar yoqadi. Va ular qiziqarli. Lekin kitoblar zerikarli.</p>",
      "uzSampleB1": "<p>Men videolarni afzal ko'raman. Videolar kitoblarga qaraganda qiziqarliroq. <br>Misol uchun, men narsalarni ko'rishim mumkin. <br>Biroq, kitoblarda ko'proq ma'lumot bor. Bu men nimani o'rganmoqchiligimga bog'liq.</p>",
      "uzSampleB2": "<p>Men odatda nimadir o'rganish uchun kitob o'qishni afzal ko'raman. O'qiyotganimda yaxshiroq diqqatni jamlay olaman deb o'ylayman. <br>Qolaversa, tushunmagan joylarimni qayta ko'rib chiqishim mumkin. <br>Biroq, ba'zi odamlar videolarni afzal ko'rishlarini tushunaman. Bu haqiqatan ham sizning o'rganish uslubingizga bog'liq.</p>"
